e the hard work so you don't have to explain slow load\\ntimes to your manager.\"})})]}),n(a,{value:\"item-11\",className:\"\",children:[t(c,{className:\"\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"Is there documentation and examples?\"})}),t(s,{className:\"text-muted-foreground\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"Yes. We provide comprehensive documentation, code examples, and real-world use cases. No PhD in\\ncomputer science required. The docs are written by developers for developers, with the assumption\\nthat you're smart enough to figure things out when given clear information.\"})})]}),n(a,{value:\"item-12\",className:\"\",children:[t(c,{className:\"\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"What's the license?\"})}),t(s,{className:\"text-muted-foreground\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"@gentleduck/ui is open source. Use it in personal projects, commercial products, client work -\\nwhatever you need. We believe great tools should be accessible to everyone, not locked behind\\npaywalls or restrictive licenses.\"})})]}),n(a,{value:\"item-13\",className:\"\",children:[t(c,{className:\"\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"Does it support dark mode?\"})}),t(s,{className:\"text-muted-foreground\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"Yes, and it's not an afterthought. Light mode, dark mode, and any custom theme you can imagine.\\nThe theming system is flexible enough to handle whatever your design team throws at you. Switch\\nthemes dynamically, support user preferences, or go wild with custom color schemes.\"})})]}),n(a,{value:\"item-14\",className:\"\",children:[t(c,{className:\"\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"Who maintains this project?\"})}),t(s,{className:\"text-muted-foreground\",children:t(r.p,{children:\"@wildduck2 is the main maintainer, backed by the @gentleduck organization. He's obsessed with\\nbuilding tools that developers actually want to use and is criminally responsive to community\\nfeedback. This isn't a side project that'll be abandoned in six months. It's a long-term\\ncommitment to making web develop