    "content": "<p><componentpreview name=\"context-menu-1\" description=\"A context menu with sub menu items.\"></componentpreview></p>\n<h2>Philosophy</h2>\n<p>Context menus are power-user shortcuts -- they surface relevant actions where the user already is. We share the DropdownMenu component internals because the interaction pattern is identical; only the trigger mechanism (right-click vs button click) differs. This means you learn one API for both patterns.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<tabs defaultvalue=\"cli\">\n<tabslist>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"cli\">CLI</tabstrigger>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"manual\">Manual</tabstrigger>\n</tabslist>\n<tabscontent value=\"cli\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx @gentleduck/cli add context-menu\n</code></pre>\n</tabscontent>\n<tabscontent value=\"manual\">\n<steps>\n<p><step>Install the following dependencies:</step></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install @gentleduck/libs \n</code></pre>\n<p><step>Make sure you have the <a href=\"/docs/components/dropdown-menu\"><code>DropdownMenu</code></a> component installed in your project.</step></p>\n<p><step>Copy and paste the following code into your project.</step></p>\n<componentsource name=\"context-menu\" title=\"components/ui/context-menu.tsx\">\n<p><step>Update the import paths to match your project setup.</step></p>\n</componentsource></steps>\n</tabscontent>\n</tabs>\n<h2>Usage</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">import {\n  ContextMenu,\n  ContextMenuContent,\n  ContextMenuItem,\n  ContextMenuTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/context-menu\"\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">&#x3C;ContextMenu>\n  &#x3C;ContextMenuTrigger>Right click&#x3C;/ContextMenuTrigger>\n  &#x3C;ContextMenuContent>\n    &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>Profile&#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n    &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>Billing&#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n    &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>Team&#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n    &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>Subscription&#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n  &#x3C;/ContextMenuContent>\n&#x3C;/ContextMenu>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Component Composition</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD     A[ContextMenu] --> B[ContextMenuTrigger]     A --> C[ContextMenuContent]     C --> D[ContextMenuGroup]     D --> E[ContextMenuItem]     D --> F[ContextMenuCheckboxItem]     C --> G[ContextMenuRadioGroup]     G --> H[ContextMenuRadioItem]     C --> I[ContextMenuLabel]     C --> J[ContextMenuSeparator]     C --> K[ContextMenuSub]     K --> L[ContextMenuSubTrigger]     K --> M[ContextMenuSubContent] </code>} /></p>\n<h2>Behavior</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Right-click the trigger area to open the menu.</li>\n<li>Left-click does not open the menu; use DropdownMenu if you need click activation.</li>\n<li>Right-clicking outside closes the menu and allows the native browser menu to appear.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>API Reference</h2>\n<p>ContextMenu shares the same props as <a href=\"/docs/components/dropdown-menu\">DropdownMenu</a>. Every ContextMenu sub-component is a thin wrapper around its DropdownMenu counterpart with <code>contextMenu</code> enabled by default. See the DropdownMenu API Reference for full prop details.</p>\n<h3>ContextMenu</h3>\n<p>Root wrapper. Renders a <code>DropdownMenu</code> with <code>contextMenu</code> set to <code>true</code>.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Context menu content (trigger + menu content)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenu</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuTrigger</h3>\n<p>The right-click target area. Renders a <code>DropdownMenuTrigger</code> with default dimensions and dashed border styling.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes (merged with default <code>h-[200px] w-[300px]</code> styling)</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Trigger area content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuContent</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes (merged with <code>fixed</code> positioning)</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Menu items and groups</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuContent</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuItem</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Item content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuItem</code> props (<code>inset</code>, <code>disabled</code>, etc.).</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuCheckboxItem</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>checked</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>--</td><td>Whether the item is checked</td></tr><tr><td><code>onCheckedChange</code></td><td><code>(checked: boolean) => void</code></td><td>--</td><td>Callback when checked state changes</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Item content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuCheckboxItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuRadioGroup</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td><code>ContextMenuRadioItem</code> elements</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuRadioGroup</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuRadioItem</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Item content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuRadioItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuLabel</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes</td></tr><tr><td><code>inset</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>--</td><td>When <code>true</code>, adds left padding for alignment with items</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Label content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuLabel</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuSeparator</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSeparator</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuShortcut</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>keys</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Keyboard shortcut string (e.g. <code>\"ctrl+K\"</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>onKeysPressed</code></td><td><code>() => void</code></td><td>--</td><td>Callback when shortcut keys are pressed</td></tr><tr><td><code>colored</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Whether to apply a colored background</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuShortcut</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuGroup</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Group content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuGroup</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuSub</h3>\n<p>Submenu wrapper.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Sub-trigger and sub-content elements</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSub</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuSubTrigger</h3>\n<p>Submenu trigger element.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes</td></tr><tr><td><code>inset</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>When <code>true</code>, adds left padding for alignment</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Trigger content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSubTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>ContextMenuSubContent</h3>\n<p>Submenu content container.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Submenu items</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSubContent</code> props.</em></p>",
