    "content": "<p><componentpreview name=\"dialog-1\" description=\"A dialog for editing profile details.\"></componentpreview></p>\n<h2>Philosophy</h2>\n<p>Dialogs demand attention and block interaction -- use them when the user <em>must</em> make a decision before continuing. We split the anatomy into DialogTrigger, DialogContent, DialogHeader, etc. because every dialog has different needs but the same accessibility requirements: focus trapping, escape dismissal, and return focus.</p>\n<h2>How It's Built</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={`graph TD\nDialog[Dialog]\nDialog --> primitives[\"@gentleduck/primitives\\n/dialog\"]:::internal\nDialog --> motion[\"@gentleduck/motion\"]:::internal\nDialog --> hooks[\"@gentleduck/hooks\"]:::internal\nDialog --> libs[\"@gentleduck/libs\"]:::internal\nDialog --> lucide[\"lucide-react\"]:::external</p>\n<p>primitives --> |\"provides\"| FocusTrap[\"Focus Trapping\"]\nprimitives --> |\"provides\"| Portal[\"Portal Rendering\"]\nprimitives --> |\"provides\"| EscDismiss[\"Escape Dismiss\"]\nmotion --> |\"provides\"| AnimVariants[\"Entry/Exit\\nAnimations\"]\nhooks --> |\"provides\"| MediaQuery[\"useMediaQuery\\n(Responsive)\"]</p>\n<p>classDef external fill:#818cf8,stroke:#6366f1,color:#fff\nclassDef internal fill:#2dd4bf,stroke:#14b8a6,color:#fff\n`} /></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<tabs defaultvalue=\"cli\">\n<tabslist>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"cli\">CLI</tabstrigger>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"manual\">Manual</tabstrigger>\n</tabslist>\n<tabscontent value=\"cli\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx @gentleduck/cli add dialog\n</code></pre>\n</tabscontent>\n<tabscontent value=\"manual\">\n<steps>\n<p><step>Install the following dependencies:</step></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install @gentleduck/primitives @gentleduck/libs @gentleduck/hooks @gentleduck/motion\n</code></pre>\n<p><step>Copy and paste the following code into your project.</step></p>\n<componentsource name=\"dialog\" title=\"components/ui/dialog.tsx\">\n<p><step>Update the import paths to match your project setup.</step></p>\n</componentsource></steps>\n</tabscontent>\n</tabs>\n<h2>Usage</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\">import {\n  Dialog,\n  DialogContent,\n  DialogDescription,\n  DialogHeader,\n  DialogTitle,\n  DialogTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dialog\"\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\">&#x3C;Dialog>\n  &#x3C;DialogTrigger>Open&#x3C;/DialogTrigger>\n  &#x3C;DialogContent>\n    &#x3C;DialogHeader>\n      &#x3C;DialogTitle>Are you absolutely sure?&#x3C;/DialogTitle>\n      &#x3C;DialogDescription>\n        This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your account\n        and remove your data from our servers.\n      &#x3C;/DialogDescription>\n    &#x3C;/DialogHeader>\n  &#x3C;/DialogContent>\n&#x3C;/Dialog>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<h3>Controlled Dialog</h3>\n<componentpreview name=\"dialog-2\">\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p>To use the <code>Dialog</code> component from within a <code>Context Menu</code> or <code>Dropdown Menu</code>, you must encase the <code>Context Menu</code> or\n<code>Dropdown Menu</code> component in the <code>Dialog</code> component.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"{1, 26}\">&#x3C;Dialog>\n  &#x3C;ContextMenu>\n    &#x3C;ContextMenuTrigger>Right click&#x3C;/ContextMenuTrigger>\n    &#x3C;ContextMenuContent>\n      &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>Open&#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n      &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>Download&#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n      &#x3C;DialogTrigger asChild>\n        &#x3C;ContextMenuItem>\n          &#x3C;span>Delete&#x3C;/span>\n        &#x3C;/ContextMenuItem>\n      &#x3C;/DialogTrigger>\n    &#x3C;/ContextMenuContent>\n  &#x3C;/ContextMenu>\n  &#x3C;DialogContent>\n    &#x3C;DialogHeader>\n      &#x3C;DialogTitle>Are you absolutely sure?&#x3C;/DialogTitle>\n      &#x3C;DialogDescription>\n        This action cannot be undone. Are you sure you want to permanently\n        delete this file from our servers?\n      &#x3C;/DialogDescription>\n    &#x3C;/DialogHeader>\n    &#x3C;DialogFooter>\n      &#x3C;Button type=\"submit\">Confirm&#x3C;/Button>\n    &#x3C;/DialogFooter>\n  &#x3C;/DialogContent>\n&#x3C;/Dialog>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Component Composition</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD     A[Dialog] --> B[DialogTrigger]     A --> C[DialogContent]     C --> D[DialogHeader]     C --> E[DialogFooter]     D --> F[DialogTitle]     D --> G[DialogDescription]     C --> H[DialogCloseX] </code>} /></p>\n<h2>API Reference</h2>\n<h3>Dialog</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>closeButton</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Whether to display a close button</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard <code>DialogPrimitive.Root</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogTrigger</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Content to render inside the trigger button</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>Omit&#x3C;DialogPrimitive.Trigger, 'size' \\| 'asChild'> &#x26; Omit&#x3C;Button, 'asChild'></code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogCloseX</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>size</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>16</code></td><td>Icon size in pixels</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Custom content instead of the default <code>&#x3C;X /></code> icon</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>button</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogContent</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes applied to the content panel</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Dialog inner content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DialogPrimitive.Content</code> props (<code>renderOnce</code>, <code>forceMount</code>, etc.).</em></p>\n<h3>DialogHeader</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes applied to the header</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Header content (typically <code>DialogTitle</code> and <code>DialogDescription</code>)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DialogPrimitive.Heading</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogFooter</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes applied to the footer</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Footer content (typically action buttons)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>div</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogTitle</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes applied to the title</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Title text</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DialogPrimitive.Title</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogDescription</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS classes applied to the description</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Description text</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DialogPrimitive.Description</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DialogClose</h3>\n<p>Alias of <code>DialogTrigger</code>.</p>\n<h3>Responsive Variants</h3>\n<p>The following responsive components automatically render a <code>Dialog</code> on desktop (>=768px) and a <code>Drawer</code> on mobile. Each accepts the same props as its non-responsive counterpart.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Desktop renders</th><th>Mobile renders</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>DialogResponsive</code></td><td><code>Dialog</code></td><td><code>Drawer</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogTriggerResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogTrigger</code></td><td><code>DrawerTrigger</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogContentResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogContent</code></td><td><code>DrawerContent</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogHeaderResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogHeader</code></td><td><code>DrawerHeader</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogFooterResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogFooter</code></td><td><code>DrawerFooter</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogTitleResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogTitle</code></td><td><code>DrawerTitle</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogDescriptionResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogDescription</code></td><td><code>DrawerDescription</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>DialogCloseResponsive</code></td><td><code>DialogClose</code></td><td><code>DrawerClose</code></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/components/sheet\">Sheet</a> -- Side panel overlay, extends Dialog</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/components/drawer\">Drawer</a> -- Bottom drawer overlay, great for mobile</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/components/alert-dialog\">Alert Dialog</a> -- Confirmation dialog that requires user action</li>\n</ul></componentpreview>",
