    "content": "<p><componentpreview name=\"dropdown-menu-1\" description=\"A dropdown menu with icons, shortcuts and sub menu items.\"></componentpreview></p>\n<h2>Philosophy</h2>\n<p>Dropdown menus are the Swiss Army knife of action UIs. They group related actions behind a single trigger, keeping interfaces clean while maintaining discoverability. Our implementation layers checkbox items, radio groups, sub-menus, and keyboard shortcuts into a composable system where each feature can be used independently.</p>\n<h2>How It's Built</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={`graph TD\nDropdownMenu[DropdownMenu]\nDropdownMenu --> primitives[\"@gentleduck/primitives\\n/popover\"]:::internal\nDropdownMenu --> vim[\"@gentleduck/vim\"]:::internal\nDropdownMenu --> libs[\"@gentleduck/libs\"]:::internal\nDropdownMenu --> Button[\"Button\"]:::component\nDropdownMenu --> RadioGroup[\"RadioGroup\"]:::component\nDropdownMenu --> lucide[\"lucide-react\"]:::external</p>\n<p>primitives --> |\"provides\"| Floating[\"Floating UI\\nPositioning\"]\nprimitives --> |\"provides\"| FocusTrap[\"Focus Trapping\"]\nvim --> |\"provides\"| Shortcuts[\"Keyboard\\nShortcuts\"]\nDropdownMenu --> |\"adds\"| SubMenus[\"Nested\\nSub-menus\"]\nDropdownMenu --> |\"adds\"| CheckboxItems[\"Checkbox &#x26;\\nRadio Items\"]</p>\n<p>classDef external fill:#818cf8,stroke:#6366f1,color:#fff\nclassDef internal fill:#2dd4bf,stroke:#14b8a6,color:#fff\nclassDef component fill:#fb923c,stroke:#f97316,color:#fff\n`} /></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<tabs defaultvalue=\"cli\">\n<tabslist>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"cli\">CLI</tabstrigger>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"manual\">Manual</tabstrigger>\n</tabslist>\n<tabscontent value=\"cli\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx @gentleduck/cli add dropdown-menu\n</code></pre>\n</tabscontent>\n<tabscontent value=\"manual\">\n<steps>\n<p><step>Install the following dependencies:</step></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install @gentleduck/libs @gentleduck/primitives @gentleduck/vim\n</code></pre>\n<p><step>Add the <code>Command</code>, <code>Button</code>, <code>RadioGroup</code> and <code>Popover</code> components to your project.</step></p>\n<p>The <code>DropdownMenu</code> component uses the <a href=\"/components/command\"><code>Command</code></a>,\n<a href=\"/components/button\"><code>Button</code></a>, <a href=\"/components/radio-group\"><code>RadioGroup</code></a> and\n<a href=\"/components/popover\"><code>Popover</code></a> components. Make sure you have them installed in your project.</p>\n<p><step>Copy and paste the following code into your project.</step></p>\n<componentsource name=\"dropdown-menu\">\n<p><step>Update the import paths to match your project setup.</step></p>\n</componentsource></steps>\n</tabscontent>\n</tabs>\n<h2>Usage</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">import {\n  DropdownMenu,\n  DropdownMenuContent,\n  DropdownMenuItem,\n  DropdownMenuLabel,\n  DropdownMenuSeparator,\n  DropdownMenuTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/dropdown-menu\"\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">&#x3C;DropdownMenu>\n  &#x3C;DropdownMenuTrigger>Open&#x3C;/DropdownMenuTrigger>\n  &#x3C;DropdownMenuContent>\n    &#x3C;DropdownMenuLabel>My Account&#x3C;/DropdownMenuLabel>\n    &#x3C;DropdownMenuSeparator />\n    &#x3C;DropdownMenuItem>Profile&#x3C;/DropdownMenuItem>\n    &#x3C;DropdownMenuItem>Billing&#x3C;/DropdownMenuItem>\n    &#x3C;DropdownMenuItem>Team&#x3C;/DropdownMenuItem>\n    &#x3C;DropdownMenuItem>Subscription&#x3C;/DropdownMenuItem>\n  &#x3C;/DropdownMenuContent>\n&#x3C;/DropdownMenu>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Component Composition</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD     A[DropdownMenu] --> B[DropdownMenuTrigger]     A --> C[DropdownMenuContent]     C --> D[DropdownMenuGroup]     D --> E[DropdownMenuItem]     D --> F[DropdownMenuCheckboxItem]     C --> G[DropdownMenuRadioGroup]     G --> H[DropdownMenuRadioItem]     C --> I[DropdownMenuLabel]     C --> J[DropdownMenuSeparator]     E --> K[DropdownMenuShortcut]     C --> L[DropdownMenuSub]     L --> M[DropdownMenuSubTrigger]     L --> N[DropdownMenuSubContent] </code>} /></p>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<h3>Checkboxes</h3>\n<p><componentpreview name=\"dropdown-menu-2\" description=\"A dropdown menu with checkboxes.\"></componentpreview></p>\n<h3>Radio Group</h3>\n<p><componentpreview name=\"dropdown-menu-3\" description=\"A dropdown menu with radio items.\"></componentpreview></p>\n<h2>API Reference</h2>\n<h3>DropdownMenu</h3>\n<p>Root wrapper that provides dropdown state and context. Wraps Popover internally.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>defaultOpen</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Initial open state for uncontrolled usage</td></tr><tr><td><code>open</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Controlled open state</td></tr><tr><td><code>onOpenChange</code></td><td><code>(open: boolean) => void</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Callback when open state changes</td></tr><tr><td><code>placement</code></td><td><code>Placement</code></td><td><code>'bottom'</code></td><td>Placement relative to the trigger</td></tr><tr><td><code>sideOffset</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>4</code></td><td>Offset on the main axis</td></tr><tr><td><code>alignOffset</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>Offset on the cross axis</td></tr><tr><td><code>mainAxis</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Enables main-axis flipping while positioning</td></tr><tr><td><code>matchWidth</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Match the popover width to the trigger width</td></tr><tr><td><code>enableHover</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Open on hover instead of click</td></tr><tr><td><code>contextMenu</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Open on right-click at the cursor position</td></tr><tr><td><code>modal</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Enables focus management when content is not disabled</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>Popover</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuTrigger</h3>\n<p>Button that toggles the dropdown menu open and closed.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>asChild</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Use the child element as the trigger instead of wrapping in a button</td></tr><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes to apply</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Content rendered inside the trigger</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>PopoverTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuContent</h3>\n<p>Container for the menu items. Rendered inside a portal.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>renderOnce</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Keep content mounted after first open</td></tr><tr><td><code>disabled</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Disables focus management when true</td></tr><tr><td><code>lockScroll</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Locks page scroll while the menu is open</td></tr><tr><td><code>forceMount</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Keep content mounted for CSS-driven animations</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>PopoverContent</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuItem</h3>\n<p>An individual menu action item. Renders as a <code>Button</code> with <code>ghost</code> variant and <code>sm</code> size by default.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>inset</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Adds left padding to align with items that have icons</td></tr><tr><td><code>disabled</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Prevents interaction and styles the item as disabled</td></tr><tr><td><code>variant</code></td><td><code>'default' | 'destructive' | 'outline' | 'secondary' | 'ghost' | 'link' | 'dashed' | 'warning' | 'nothing' | 'expand_icon'</code></td><td><code>'ghost'</code></td><td>Visual variant of the button</td></tr><tr><td><code>size</code></td><td><code>'default' | 'sm' | 'lg' | 'icon' | 'icon-sm' | 'icon-lg'</code></td><td><code>'sm'</code></td><td>Size of the button</td></tr><tr><td><code>asChild</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Render as child component using Slot</td></tr><tr><td><code>loading</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Shows a loading spinner</td></tr><tr><td><code>icon</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Primary icon to display</td></tr><tr><td><code>secondIcon</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Secondary icon</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>Button</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuCheckboxItem</h3>\n<p>A menu item with a toggleable checkbox indicator.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>checked</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Controlled checked state</td></tr><tr><td><code>onCheckedChange</code></td><td><code>(checked: boolean) => void</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Callback when checked state changes</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuRadioGroup</h3>\n<p>Groups radio items together for single-selection behavior.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>value</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>The currently selected radio value</td></tr><tr><td><code>onValueChange</code></td><td><code>(value: string) => void</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Callback when the selected value changes</td></tr><tr><td><code>defaultValue</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Initial value for uncontrolled usage</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>RadioGroup</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuRadioItem</h3>\n<p>A radio-selectable menu item. Must be used inside <code>DropdownMenuRadioGroup</code>.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>value</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>The value representing this radio item</td></tr><tr><td><code>customIndicator</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Custom indicator element</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>RadioGroupItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuLabel</h3>\n<p>A non-interactive label for grouping menu items.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>inset</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Adds left padding to align with inset menu items</td></tr><tr><td><code>htmlFor</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Associates the label with a form control by its <code>id</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes to apply</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>label</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuSeparator</h3>\n<p>A visual divider between groups of menu items.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes to apply</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>div</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuShortcut</h3>\n<p>Displays a keyboard shortcut hint next to a menu item and registers the key binding.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>keys</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>Keyboard shortcut string (e.g. <code>\"ctrl+K\"</code>)</td></tr><tr><td><code>onKeysPressed</code></td><td><code>() => void</code></td><td>(required)</td><td>Callback invoked when the shortcut keys are pressed</td></tr><tr><td><code>colored</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Applies a muted background to the shortcut badge</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>kbd</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuGroup</h3>\n<p>Groups related menu items together.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes to apply</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Menu items to render inside the group</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>div</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuSub</h3>\n<p>Wrapper for a submenu. Creates a nested popover with hover activation.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>contextMenu</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Open on right-click at the cursor position</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>Popover</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuSubTrigger</h3>\n<p>Trigger element for a submenu. Displays a chevron icon indicating a nested menu.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>inset</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Adds left padding to align with inset menu items</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>PopoverTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>DropdownMenuSubContent</h3>\n<p>Content container for a submenu.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>disabled</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Disables focus management when true</td></tr><tr><td><code>lockScroll</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Locks page scroll while the submenu is open</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>PopoverContent</code> props.</em></p>",
