    "content": "<componentpreview name=\"menubar-1\" description=\"A menubar component.\">\n<h2>Philosophy</h2>\n<p>Menubars bring desktop-application navigation patterns to the web. The keyboard model (arrow keys between menus, type-ahead search within items) follows established platform conventions because muscle memory matters more than novelty. We build on DropdownMenu internals so each menu panel gets the same rich feature set.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<tabs defaultvalue=\"cli\">\n<tabslist>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"cli\">CLI</tabstrigger>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"manual\">Manual</tabstrigger>\n</tabslist>\n<tabscontent value=\"cli\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx @gentleduck/cli add menubar\n</code></pre>\n</tabscontent>\n<tabscontent value=\"manual\">\n<steps>\n<p><step>Install the following dependencies:</step></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install @gentleduck/libs \n</code></pre>\n<p><step>Make sure you have the <a href=\"/docs/components/dialog\"><code>DropdownMenu</code></a> and\n<a href=\"/docs/components/button\"><code>Button</code></a> components installed in your project.</step></p>\n<p><step>Copy and paste the following code into your project.</step></p>\n<componentsource name=\"menubar\">\n<p><step>Update the import paths to match your project setup.</step></p>\n</componentsource></steps>\n</tabscontent>\n</tabs>\n<h2>Usage</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">import {\n  Menubar,\n  MenubarContent,\n  MenubarItem,\n  MenubarMenu,\n  MenubarSeparator,\n  MenubarShortcut,\n  MenubarTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/menubar\"\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">&#x3C;Menubar>\n  &#x3C;MenubarMenu>\n    &#x3C;MenubarTrigger>File&#x3C;/MenubarTrigger>\n    &#x3C;MenubarContent>\n      &#x3C;MenubarItem>\n        New Tab &#x3C;MenubarShortcut>⌘T&#x3C;/MenubarShortcut>\n      &#x3C;/MenubarItem>\n      &#x3C;MenubarItem>New Window&#x3C;/MenubarItem>\n      &#x3C;MenubarSeparator />\n      &#x3C;MenubarItem>Share&#x3C;/MenubarItem>\n      &#x3C;MenubarSeparator />\n      &#x3C;MenubarItem>Print&#x3C;/MenubarItem>\n    &#x3C;/MenubarContent>\n  &#x3C;/MenubarMenu>\n&#x3C;/Menubar>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Component Composition</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD     A[Menubar] --> B[MenubarMenu]     B --> C[MenubarTrigger]     B --> D[MenubarContent]     D --> E[MenubarItem]     D --> F[MenubarCheckboxItem]     D --> G[MenubarRadioGroup]     G --> H[MenubarRadioItem]     D --> I[MenubarLabel]     D --> J[MenubarSeparator]     D --> K[MenubarSub]     K --> L[MenubarSubTrigger]     K --> M[MenubarSubContent] </code>} /></p>\n<h2>API Reference</h2>\n<h3>Menubar</h3>\n<p>Root container that renders a horizontal bar and manages keyboard navigation across all menus. Provides <code>MenubarContext</code> for coordinating open state, trigger focus, and arrow-key movement between menus.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes for the menubar container</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td><code>MenubarMenu</code> items to render inside the bar</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>div</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarMenu</h3>\n<p>Wrapper for an individual menu within the menubar. Renders a <code>DropdownMenu</code> internally.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes for the menu wrapper</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Trigger and content elements for this menu</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>div</code> props (excluding <code>contextMenu</code>).</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarTrigger</h3>\n<p>Button that opens a specific menu in the menubar. Styled as a ghost button with <code>sm</code> size.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes for the trigger button</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Label content for the trigger</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarContent</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes for the dropdown content</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Menu items to render inside the dropdown</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuContent</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarItem</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Additional CSS classes for the menu item</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Content of the menu item</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>DropdownMenuItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarCheckboxItem</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuCheckboxItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarRadioGroup</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuRadioGroup</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarRadioItem</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuRadioItem</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarLabel</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuLabel</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarSeparator</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSeparator</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarShortcut</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuShortcut</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarGroup</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuGroup</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarSub</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSub</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarSubTrigger</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSubTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>MenubarSubContent</h3>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>DropdownMenuSubContent</code> props.</em></p></componentpreview>",
