    "content": "<p><componentpreview name=\"popover-1\" description=\"A popover component with a form.\"></componentpreview></p>\n<h2>About</h2>\n<p>Popover built with <a href=\"https://floating-ui.com/\">@floating-ui/react</a>. Supports click, hover, and context menu triggers with smart placement.</p>\n<h2>Philosophy</h2>\n<p>Popovers bridge the gap between tooltips (hover, no interaction) and dialogs (heavy, blocking). They're the right choice for inline forms, color pickers, and contextual actions that need more space than a tooltip but shouldn't interrupt the user's flow. We handle positioning and collision detection so you can focus on content.</p>\n<h2>How It's Built</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={`graph TD\nPopover[Popover]\nPopover --> primitives[\"@gentleduck/primitives\\n/popover\"]:::internal\nPopover --> motion[\"@gentleduck/motion\"]:::internal\nPopover --> libs[\"@gentleduck/libs\"]:::internal</p>\n<p>primitives --> |\"uses\"| floatingUI[\"Floating UI\"]:::external\nprimitives --> |\"provides\"| Positioning[\"Collision-aware\\nPositioning\"]\nprimitives --> |\"provides\"| FocusTrap[\"Focus Trapping\"]\nprimitives --> |\"provides\"| ClickOutside[\"Click Outside\\nDismiss\"]\nmotion --> |\"provides\"| AnimVariants[\"Entry/Exit\\nAnimations\"]</p>\n<p>Popover -.- |\"used by\"| Select[\"Select\"]:::component\nPopover -.- |\"used by\"| DropdownMenu[\"DropdownMenu\"]:::component\nPopover -.- |\"used by\"| Combobox[\"Combobox\"]:::component\nPopover -.- |\"used by\"| DatePicker[\"DatePicker\"]:::component</p>\n<p>classDef external fill:#818cf8,stroke:#6366f1,color:#fff\nclassDef internal fill:#2dd4bf,stroke:#14b8a6,color:#fff\nclassDef component fill:#fb923c,stroke:#f97316,color:#fff\n`} /></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<tabs defaultvalue=\"cli\">\n<tabslist>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"cli\">CLI</tabstrigger>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"manual\">Manual</tabstrigger>\n</tabslist>\n<tabscontent value=\"cli\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx @gentleduck/cli add popover\n</code></pre>\n</tabscontent>\n<tabscontent value=\"manual\">\n<steps>\n<p><step>Install the following dependencies:</step></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install @gentleduck/libs @gentleduck/primitives @gentleduck/motion @gentleduck/variants\n</code></pre>\n<p><step>Copy and paste the following code into your project.</step></p>\n<componentsource name=\"popover\">\n<p><step>Update the import paths to match your project setup.</step></p>\n</componentsource></steps>\n</tabscontent>\n</tabs>\n<h2>Usage</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">import {\n  Popover,\n  PopoverContent,\n  PopoverTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/popover\"\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"showLineNumbers\">&#x3C;Popover>\n  &#x3C;PopoverTrigger>Open&#x3C;/PopoverTrigger>\n  &#x3C;PopoverContent>Place content for the popover here.&#x3C;/PopoverContent>\n&#x3C;/Popover>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Component Composition</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD     A[Popover] --> B[PopoverTrigger]     A --> C[PopoverContent]     A --> D[PopoverPortal]     C --> E[PopoverClose] </code>} /></p>\n<h2>API Reference</h2>\n<h3>Popover</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>defaultOpen</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Initial open state for uncontrolled usage</td></tr><tr><td><code>open</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Controlled open state</td></tr><tr><td><code>onOpenChange</code></td><td><code>(open: boolean) => void</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Callback when open state changes</td></tr><tr><td><code>placement</code></td><td><code>Placement</code></td><td><code>'bottom'</code></td><td>Placement relative to the trigger</td></tr><tr><td><code>sideOffset</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>4</code></td><td>Offset on the main axis</td></tr><tr><td><code>alignOffset</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>0</code></td><td>Offset on the cross axis</td></tr><tr><td><code>mainAxis</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Enables main-axis flipping while positioning</td></tr><tr><td><code>matchWidth</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Match the popover width to the trigger width</td></tr><tr><td><code>enableHover</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Open on hover instead of click</td></tr><tr><td><code>contextMenu</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Open on right-click at the cursor position</td></tr><tr><td><code>modal</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Enables focus management when content is not disabled</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard <code>PopoverPrimitive.Root</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>PopoverTrigger</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>asChild</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Use the child element as the trigger</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard <code>PopoverPrimitive.Trigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>PopoverContent</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>forceMount</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Keep content mounted for CSS-driven animations</td></tr><tr><td><code>lockScroll</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Locks scroll while the popover is open</td></tr><tr><td><code>disabled</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Disables focus management when true</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard <code>PopoverPrimitive.Content</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>PopoverClose</h3>\n<p>Alias for <code>PopoverTrigger</code>. Use to render an element that closes the popover.</p>\n<p><em>Accepts all <code>PopoverTrigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>PopoverPortal</h3>\n<p>Renders the popover in a portal using Floating UI.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td><code>--</code></td><td>Content to render inside the portal</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>PopoverPrimitive.Portal</code> props.</em></p>",
