    "content": "<componentpreview name=\"sheet-1\" description=\"A sheet component.\">\n<h2>Philosophy</h2>\n<p>Sheets are dialogs that slide in from the edge -- they maintain spatial context better than centered modals. Use them for supplementary content (settings panels, detail views, mobile navigation) where the user needs to reference what's behind the overlay. The side prop makes the direction of information flow explicit.</p>\n<h2>How It's Built</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD   Sheet[Sheet]   Sheet --> primitives[\"@gentleduck/primitives\\n/sheet\"]:::internal   Sheet --> motion[\"@gentleduck/motion\"]:::internal   Sheet --> variants[\"@gentleduck/variants\"]:::internal   Sheet --> libs[\"@gentleduck/libs\"]:::internal   primitives --> |\"provides\"| FocusTrap[\"Focus Trapping\"]   primitives --> |\"provides\"| Portal[\"Portal Rendering\"]   motion --> |\"provides\"| SlideAnim[\"Slide-in\\nAnimations\"]   variants --> |\"provides\"| SideVariant[\"Side Variants\\n(top, right, bottom, left)\"]   classDef internal fill:#2dd4bf,stroke:#14b8a6,color:#fff </code>} /></p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<tabs defaultvalue=\"cli\">\n<tabslist>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"cli\">CLI</tabstrigger>\n  <tabstrigger value=\"manual\">Manual</tabstrigger>\n</tabslist>\n<tabscontent value=\"cli\">\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npx @gentleduck/cli add sheet\n</code></pre>\n</tabscontent>\n<tabscontent value=\"manual\">\n<steps>\n<p><step>Install the following dependencies:</step></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">npm install @gentleduck/primitives @gentleduck/libs @gentleduck/motion @gentleduck/variants\n</code></pre>\n<p><step>Copy and paste the following code into your project.</step></p>\n<componentsource name=\"sheet\">\n<p><step>Update the import paths to match your project setup.</step></p>\n</componentsource></steps>\n</tabscontent>\n</tabs>\n<h3>Usage</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\">import {\n  Sheet,\n  SheetContent,\n  SheetDescription,\n  SheetHeader,\n  SheetTitle,\n  SheetTrigger,\n} from \"@/components/ui/sheet\"\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\">&#x3C;Sheet>\n  &#x3C;SheetTrigger>Open&#x3C;/SheetTrigger>\n  &#x3C;SheetContent>\n    &#x3C;SheetHeader>\n      &#x3C;SheetTitle>Are you absolutely sure?&#x3C;/SheetTitle>\n      &#x3C;SheetDescription>\n        This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your account\n        and remove your data from our servers.\n      &#x3C;/SheetDescription>\n    &#x3C;/SheetHeader>\n  &#x3C;/SheetContent>\n&#x3C;/Sheet>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Examples</h2>\n<h3>Side</h3>\n<p>Use the <code>side</code> property to <code>&#x3C;SheetContent /></code> to indicate the edge of the screen where the component will appear. The values can be <code>top</code>, <code>right</code>, <code>bottom</code> or <code>left</code>.</p>\n<componentpreview name=\"sheet-2\">\n<h3>Size</h3>\n<p>You can adjust the size of the sheet using CSS classes:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-tsx\" metastring=\"{3}\">&#x3C;Sheet>\n  &#x3C;SheetTrigger>Open&#x3C;/SheetTrigger>\n  &#x3C;SheetContent className=\"w-[400px] sm:w-[540px]\">\n    &#x3C;SheetHeader>\n      &#x3C;SheetTitle>Are you absolutely sure?&#x3C;/SheetTitle>\n      &#x3C;SheetDescription>\n        This action cannot be undone. This will permanently delete your account\n        and remove your data from our servers.\n      &#x3C;/SheetDescription>\n    &#x3C;/SheetHeader>\n  &#x3C;/SheetContent>\n&#x3C;/Sheet>\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Component Composition</h2>\n<p>&#x3C;MermaidDiagram chart={<code>graph TD     A[Sheet] --> B[SheetTrigger]     A --> C[SheetContent]     C --> D[SheetHeader]     C --> E[SheetFooter]     D --> F[SheetTitle]     D --> G[SheetDescription]     C --> H[SheetClose] </code>} /></p>\n<h2>API Reference</h2>\n<h3>Sheet</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>closeButton</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code></td><td>Whether to show the default close button on the sheet</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>SheetPrimitive.Root</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetTrigger</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Trigger content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>SheetPrimitive.Trigger</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetCloseX</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>size</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td><code>16</code></td><td>Size of the close icon in pixels</td></tr><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS class names</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Custom close icon content (defaults to <code>X</code> icon)</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>button</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetContent</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>side</code></td><td><code>'top' | 'right' | 'bottom' | 'left'</code></td><td><code>'right'</code></td><td>The side from which the sheet slides in</td></tr><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS class names</td></tr><tr><td><code>children</code></td><td><code>React.ReactNode</code></td><td>--</td><td>Sheet content</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>SheetPrimitive.Content</code> props and <code>VariantProps&#x3C;typeof AnimSheetVariants></code>.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetHeader</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS class names</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>SheetPrimitive.Heading</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetFooter</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS class names</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all standard HTML <code>div</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetTitle</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS class names</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>SheetPrimitive.Title</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetDescription</h3>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table><thead><tr><th>Prop</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>--</td><td>Additional CSS class names</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><em>Also accepts all <code>SheetPrimitive.Description</code> props.</em></p>\n<h3>SheetClose</h3>\n<p>Alias for <code>SheetTrigger</code>. Accepts the same props.</p>\n<h2>See also</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/components/dialog\">Dialog</a> -- Centered modal overlay</li>\n<li><a href=\"/docs/components/drawer\">Drawer</a> -- Bottom drawer overlay, great for mobile</li>\n</ul></componentpreview></componentpreview>",
